            A yard French drain typically costs roughly 15 to 50 dollars per linear foot installed, while an interior basement perimeter drain typically runs roughly 40 to 100 dollars per foot, usually with a sump pump. Length, depth, soil, access, the outlet and finished surfaces decide where your job lands.
